      {
        "lesson": "math5-c2-s3-n51",
        "exercise": "973",
        "text": "973. 计算：\n1) $3^2\\cdot1\\frac{1}{6}$；\n2) $2\\frac{2}{3}:2^3$；\n3) $(3.1)^3+2.75$；\n4) $26-(2.1)^2$；\n5) $\\left(-1\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2\\cdot(-2)^3$；\n6) $\\left(-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^3:\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^2$."
