        "text": "979. 化简下列各式：\n1) $-8.1\\cdot(5k-2.4)+3.4\\cdot(7k+1.3)$；\n2) $4.6\\cdot(4p+3.8)-2.7\\cdot(11p-1.8)$；\n3) $2.6\\cdot(3.5-8x)-4.1\\cdot(1.9+3x)$；\n4) $-3.9\\cdot(1.6+6y)+2.5\\cdot(4.6-2y)$."
