        "text": "981. 计算：\n1) $\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}$；\n2) $\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{2}{5}$；\n3) $\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}$；\n4) $\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{2}{5}$；\n5) $\\frac{5}{7}-\\frac{1}{6}$；\n6) $-\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{1}{3}$；\n7) $\\frac{4}{9}-\\frac{4}{5}$；\n8) $-\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{3}{5}$；\n9) $\\frac{5}{8}-\\frac{2}{3}$；\n10) $-\\frac{7}{10}-\\frac{4}{7}$；\n11) $\\frac{1}{12}-\\frac{9}{11}$；\n12) $-\\frac{4}{5}-\\frac{5}{6}$."
